unt, X=Payment platform discount, Y=Retail Delivery Fee, Z=Taxes, AA=Order Amount, AB=Order Refund Amount, AC=Created Time, AD=Paid Time, AE=RTS Time, AF=Shipped Time, AG=Delivered Time, AH=Cancelled Time, AI=Cancel By, AJ=Cancel Reason, AK=Fulfillment Type, AL=Warehouse Name, AM=Tracking ID, AN=Delivery Option Type, AO=Delivery Option, AP=Shipping Provider Name, AQ=Buyer Message, AR=Buyer Nickname, AS=Buyer Username, AT=Recipient, AU=Phone #, AV=Country, AW=State, AX=City, AY=Zipcode, AZ=Address Line 1, BA=Address Line 2, BB=Delivery Instruction, BC=Payment Method, BD=Weight(kg), BE=Product Category, BF=Package ID, BG=Seller Note, BH=Shipping Information, BI=Combined Listing, BJ=Order Channel, BK=Creator Handle\n部分字段描述：Order ID（Platform unique order ID.）; Order Status（Current order status.）; Cancelation/Return Type（The filed to explain the order is in cancellation or in return/refund.）; SKU ID（Platform SKU ID.）; Seller SKU（Seller sku input by the seller in the product system.）; Product Name（Platform product name.）; Variation（Platform SKU variation）; Quantity（SKU sold quantity in the order.）'), 0.004943926738296023), (Document(metadata={'range': 'A1:BK2', 'column_end': 63, 'chunk_index': 1, 'chunk_type': 'sheet_schema', 'source': '直邮一店 8.20号订单.xlsx#OrderSKUList!A1:BK2', 'source_uri': '直邮一店 8.20号订单.xlsx#OrderSKUList!A1:BK2', 'row_start': 1, 'file_size': 19072, 'document_id': 'a1a6dcc605584cef82bd9eaeb7c18049', 'sheet_name': 'OrderSKUList', 'table_id': 'OrderSKUList#0', 'column_start': 1, 'filename': '直邮一店 8.20号订单.xlsx', 'processed_at': '2026-09-14T17:03:31.936320', 'user_id': 151, 'file_type': 'xlsx', 'row_end': 2}, page_content="工作表「OrderSKUList」字段结构（表 OrderSKUList#0，共 63 列）：\nA Order ID — Platform unique order ID. （类型：numeric）\nB Order Status — Current order status. （类型：text）\nC Order Substatus （类型：text）\nD Cancelation/Return Type — The filed to explain the order is in cancellation or in return/refund. （类型：text）\nE Normal or Pre-order （类型：text）\nF SKU ID — Platform SKU ID. （类型：numeric）\nG Seller SKU — Seller sku input by the seller in the product system. （类型：date）\nH Product ID （类型：numeric）\nI Product Name — Platform product name. （类型：text）\nJ Variation — Platform SKU variation （类型：text）\nK  Virtual Bundle Seller SKU （类型：text）\nL Quantity — SKU sold quantity in the order. （类型：numeric）\nM Sku Quantity of return — SKU returned quantity in the order. （类型：numeric）\nN SKU Unit Original Price — 1 SKU original price. （类型：numeric）\nO SKU Subtotal Before Discount — It equals to SKU Unit Original Price * Sku Quantity. （类型：numeric）\nP SKU Platform Discount — Total platform discount in this SKU ID. （类型：numeric）\nQ SKU Seller Discount — Total seller discount in this SKU ID. （类型：numeric）\nR SKU Subtotal After Discount — It equals SKU Subtotal Before Discount - SKU Platform Discount - SKU Seller Discount. （类型：numeric）\nS Shipping Fee After Discount — It equals to Original Shipping Fee - Shipping Fee Seller Discount - Shipping Fee Platform Discount. （类型：numeric）\nT Original Shipping Fee — The order's original shipping fee. （类型：numeric）\nU Shipping Fee Seller Discount — The order's  shipping fee discount from the seller. （类型：numeric）\nV Co-Funded Shipping Fee Discount — Co-funded shipping fee discount: The shipping fee is initially covered by the seller. For eligible orders, TikTok Shop will reimburse a specified amount upon delivery, based on the terms of the Co-Funded Free Shipping program. （类型：numeric）\nW Shipping Fee Platform Discount — The order's  shipping fee discount from the platform. （类型：numeric）\nX Payment platform discount — The discount provided by a third-party payment platform, which the buyer used to place the order. （类型：text）\nY Retail Delivery Fee （类型：numeric）\nZ Taxes （类型：numeric）\nAA Order Amount — Order total amount paid by the buyer. （类型：numeric）\nAB Order Refund Amount — Order total refund amount of all returned SKUs. （类型：text）\nAC Created Time — Order created time. （类型：date）\nAD Paid Time — Order paid time. （类型：date）\nAE RTS Time — The time when the seller clicks 'arrange shipment'. （类型：date）\nAF Shipped Time — The time when the order status changes to In Transit. （类型：date）\nAG Delivered Time — The time when the order status changes to Delivered. （类型：text）\nAH Cancelled Time — The time when the order status changes to Cancelled. （类型：text）\nAI Cancel By — The order is cancelled by whom. （类型：text）\nAJ Cancel Reason — The order cancel reason. （类型：text）\nAK Fulfillment Type （类型：text）\nAL Warehouse Name （类型：text）\nAM Tracking ID — The order's tracking number. （类型：text）\nAN Delivery Option Type （类型：text）\nAO Delivery Option — The order's delivery option. （类型：text）\nAP Shipping Provider Name — The order's shipping provider name. （类型：text）\nAQ Buyer Message （类型：text）\nAR Buyer Nickname （类型：text）\nAS Buyer Username （类型：text）\nAT Recipient （类型：text）\nAU Phone # （类型：text）\nAV Country （类型：text）\nAW State （类型：text）\nAX City （类型：text）\nAY Zipcode （类型：numeric）\nAZ Address Line 1 （类型：text）\nBA Address Line 2 （类型：text）\nBB Delivery Instruction （类型：text）\nBC Payment Method — The order's payment method. （类型：text）\nBD Weight(kg) （类型：numeric）\nBE Product Category — SKU's product category. （类型：text）\nBF Package ID — The order's Package ID （类型：numeric）\nBG Seller Note （类型：text）\nBH Shipping Information （类型：text）\nBI Combined Listing （类型：text）\nBJ Order Channel （类型：text）\nBK Creator Handle （类型：text）"), -0.012043023379231688)]
